- core/models.py: PRICE_MIN and PRICE_MAX

Changes from the upstream excerpt: the parser is a module function instead of
a classmethod, and browser, login, challenge, and network code are omitted.
The text-parser behavior of that commit is otherwise unchanged.

A normal git clone of the default branch does not contain this commit, so
`git checkout ca55181167a2a0856d577c542c815655679478ea` fails with
"fatal: unable to read tree". This copy was taken from a direct fetch of
that commit. It is not upstream HEAD (67587ba0114db439b2d5e2ad1e45b7ca5894301b
at the time of vendoring). Do not replace this file by cloning HEAD.
